---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Methodology" description="How Proterra Signal discovers, ranks, and reviews industry developments.">
  <section class="page-heading reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Editorial methodology</div>
    <h1>How the signal is selected</h1>
    <p>A repeatable research and review process designed to favor consequence over volume.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="method-grid reveal delay-1">
    <article><span>01</span><h2>Discover</h2><p>Search the previous seven days across approved sources, with up to 30 days of context for continuing developments.</p></article>
    <article><span>02</span><h2>Verify</h2><p>Trace claims to exact publications. Promotional, broad, or disputed claims require independent context.</p></article>
    <article><span>03</span><h2>Rank</h2><p>Score candidates for impact, source confidence, Proterra relevance, breadth, momentum, and novelty.</p></article>
    <article><span>04</span><h2>Review</h2><p>Validate links, claims, balance, and interpretation in a protected preview before publication.</p></article>
  </section>

  <section class="rubric reveal delay-2">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Ranking rubric</div>
      <h2>Importance is explicit.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="rubric-table">
      <div><span>Industry or economic impact</span><strong>25%</strong></div>
      <div><span>Source confidence</span><strong>20%</strong></div>
      <div><span>Relevance to Proterra</span><strong>15%</strong></div>
      <div><span>Breadth across markets</span><strong>15%</strong></div>
      <div><span>Persistence or momentum</span><strong>15%</strong></div>
      <div><span>Novelty</span><strong>10%</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="guardrails reveal">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Publication guardrails</div>
      <h2>What an approved issue must contain</h2>
    </div>
    <ul>
      <li><span>8–10</span> supported developments</li>
      <li><span>2+</span> items from each sector</li>
      <li><span>3+</span> primarily U.S. items</li>
      <li><span>3+</span> primarily international items</li>
      <li><span>100%</span> exact source attribution</li>
      <li><span>1</span> named human approval</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
